<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #1a5f7a;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #1a5f7a;
        }

        .order-summary-card {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .order-number {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .order-id {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .items-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .items-table th {
            text-align: left;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .items-table td {
            padding: 15px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .item-name {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .item-qty {
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .item-price {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #0f172a;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .totals-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 300px;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .totals-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .totals-row.grand-total {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #1a5f7a;
            border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-top: 15px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #1a5f7a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Mirabooks</h1>
            <p>Your journey begins here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hello {{customer_name}},</div>
            <p>Thank you for shopping with Mirabooks! We've received your order and are getting it ready for shipment.
                Below are the details of your purchase.</p>

            <div class="order-summary-card">
                <div class="order-number">Order Reference</div>
                <h2 class="order-id">#{{order_number}}</h2>
            </div>

            <table class="items-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Item</th>
                        <th style="text-align: center;">Qty</th>
                        <th style="text-align: right;">Price</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each items}}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="item-name">{{title}}</td>
                        <td class="item-qty">{{quantity}}</td>
                        <td class="item-price">₦{{unit_price}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <table class="totals-container" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #475569; text-align: right; padding-right: 20px;">Subtotal</td>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #475569; text-align: right; width: 100px;">₦{{subtotal}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #475569; text-align: right; padding-right: 20px;">Shipping</td>
                    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #475569; text-align: right;">₦{{shipping_cost}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td
                        style="padding: 15px 0 8px 0; color: #1a5f7a; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-right: 20px;">
                        Total</td>
                    <td
                        style="padding: 15px 0 8px 0; color: #1a5f7a; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #e2e8f0;">
                        ₦{{total}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 15px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6;">
                We hope you enjoy your new books! If you have any questions or need to make changes to your order,
                simply reply to this email or contact our support team.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2026 Mirabooks. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>123 Bookworm Lane, Reading City, 10001</p>
            <p><a href="https://mirabooks.com">Visit our website</a> | <a href="mailto:support@mirabooks.com">Contact
                    Support</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>